SEL: PEAT refuses to send SEL ASCII commands that change the state of a relay (e.g. ``SER C``, ``TAR R``, ``MET RD``, ``STA C``, ``SET``, ``PAS``, ``L_D``, the SEL-710 and SEL-749M ``STR`` and ``STO`` motor commands, or ``Y``) with the new ``SELCommandRefused``, except in the restart, push, active group change, and level C login code paths. The commands and the list of read-only commands PEAT uses are in the new ``peat.modules.sel.sel_commands``.
